WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.048
Surrounding words, relationships and sentence clues help reveal unfamiliar word

00:00:05.048 --> 00:00:05.533
meanings.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:11.075
“The path was narrow, so only one person could walk across.” Narrow means what?

00:00:11.075 --> 00:00:12.084
Answer: Not wide

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:17.025
Underline a clue in a sentence that helps you infer the meaning of a new word.

00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:20.981
Discuss why: Only one person fits across the path.
